@startuml 07-state-session-lifecycle
!include _style.puml

title ClassLink Current POC — Teacher Session Lifecycle
caption Current POC — in-memory session lifecycle, not persisted to a database

state Idle #AED6F1
state CheckingBluetooth #AED6F1
state GeneratingCode #AED6F1
state Advertising #C8E6C9
state ReceivingCheckIns #C8E6C9
state Stopping #AED6F1
state Ended #AED6F1
state Error #F5B7B1

[*] --> Idle

Idle --> CheckingBluetooth : Teacher selects\nStart Session
CheckingBluetooth --> GeneratingCode : Bluetooth ready
CheckingBluetooth --> Error : Bluetooth off / unauthorized /\nunsupported / timeout
GeneratingCode --> Advertising : Code generated and\ntransport prepared
Advertising --> ReceivingCheckIns : Service is visible\nto students
ReceivingCheckIns --> ReceivingCheckIns : Student payload received
ReceivingCheckIns --> Stopping : Teacher selects\nStop Session
Advertising --> Stopping : Teacher selects Stop Session\nbefore any check-in
Stopping --> Ended : Advertising stopped\nsuccessfully
Error --> Idle : User retries or returns
Ended --> Idle : Start a new session

note bottom of ReceivingCheckIns
  The current implementation stores received check-ins
  only during the active local session. Permanent
  database storage is future work.
end note

@enduml
